// in Enterprsr and the full-colour logo R, as inline SVG (two pieces so CSS can move them apart).
// Generated from the built font (Enterprsr 1.001, kerning included: hyphen-R -269) and the locked
// colour logo (round4 #13). Inline SVG rather than a WOFF2: it is pixel-exact at any size, the
// colour R cannot come from a font anyway, and the font files stay out of this public repo.
// Both pieces share one vertical band (font units -338..1649), so equal heights line them up;
// the word is silver (currentColor, --logo-silver), the logo keeps its own colours: sage stem
// #77AF8A and the bowl in the UI Accent amber #F0A202 (palette option B).
